9
00:00:20,375 --> 00:00:21,445
Wait, wait,
hold on, do what?

10
00:00:21,443 --> 00:00:23,773
(Sheldon:)Excuse me...
that's my room.

11
00:00:23,779 --> 00:00:25,079
(Leonard:)But you won't be living here.

12
00:00:25,080 --> 00:00:26,510
(Sheldon:)But that's my room.

13
00:00:26,515 --> 00:00:28,045
(Leonard:)But you won't be living here.
But that's my room.

14
00:00:28,050 --> 00:00:29,320
(Leonard:)You guys might want
to start eating.

15
00:00:29,318 --> 00:00:30,748
(Leonard:)But you won't be living here.

16
00:00:31,920 --> 00:00:33,290
(Penny:)Sweetie,
once you stop paying rent,

17
00:00:33,288 --> 00:00:34,888
(Penny:)none of this is really yours.

18
00:00:34,890 --> 00:00:36,020
(Sheldon:)But that's my room.

19
00:00:36,024 --> 00:00:38,254
But you won't be living here!

20
