(Sheldon:)Thank you
for understanding.

21
00:00:43,265 --> 00:00:44,895
(Sheldon:)Hey, I get it.

22
00:00:44,900 --> 00:00:47,730
(Sheldon:)Everybody wants to spend
more time with me.

23
00:00:49,171 --> 00:00:51,701
(Sheldon:)I'm like a man made of sugar
in a world of ants.

24
